{"text": "Just then there came a third knock, and when the door was opened, a short man in a neat dark suit stood on the step. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He began to ask the way to a nearby village, but his eyes fell upon the man in gray, who was still singing by the fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His face turned white, his knees shook, and without saying another word he turned and ran out into the stormy night as fast as he could. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The guests were still wondering what had frightened him so much when a heavy boom sounded across the hills from the direction of Casterbridge. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That is the jail gun, cried the hangman, jumping up, and it means that a prisoner has escaped, surely the very man I came for. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everyone at once concluded that the little man who had run away must be the escaped prisoner, since nobody else would have fled at the sight of the hangman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hangman urged the constable, who happened to be among the guests, to gather the men at once and chase the runaway across the dark hills. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So, with lanterns and sticks in their hands, the men hurried out into the rain, leaving the warm room almost empty behind them.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "a", " ", "t", "h", "i", "r", "d", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", ",", " ", "a", " ", "s", "h", "o", "r", "t", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "n", "e", "a", "t", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", " ", "s", "u", "i", "t", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "b", "e",